and ice spells with immersive effects\n- Real-world interaction using MR\n- Responsive sound and impact effects\n\n[Controls]\n- Hand gestures only\n- Simple and intuitive actions:\n  - Palm up: generate magic energy\n  - Fist: charge power\n  - Open hand forward: release your spell\n\n[Recommended for]\n- MR / VR beginners\n- Anyone who wants to feel like a wizard in real life\n\n[Note]\n- This is a magic experience focused on visual effects and immersion.\n- No enemies or combat gameplay.", "short_description": "Shoot fire and ice ball in MR space!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://yyoshifactory-dotcom.github.io/plivacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Yoshimoto Factory", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://yyoshifactory-dotcom.github.io/plivacypolicy/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "35863305389926928"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299093_26128554256765297_7662644768374668952_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UXx6PDsT5IEQ7kNvwGPnnIP&_nc_oc=AdoYs42WW1wmOzsPISTnNI3wKCN-oR953gaD2xJaiXn8rMPPEa0YpWrVFkYueGXulPg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7Jy_E8TSSP3equ2qcrDcTboLqHX3bvOmItRdYAXU